Yet Another Not Quite Ascension Post

In short, I made it to the Astral Plane and was doing fine. I sacrificed 
the amulet at the second altar, only to find to my dismay that I'd 
misread "Mog" as "Kos" (they look very similar, I think). I even 
specifically checked the gods with ctrl-x! And yes, I should have 
noticed the lack of "A sense of peace", but there were no foes in the 
room to run from me.

I was impressed by how easy the Rogue class was. I played the whole game 
with two daggers and a stack for throwing, no artifacts needed! I had 
some considerable trouble on the Planes when I realized I had no means 
of confusion (only really a problem with Fire) and since I had only a 
single !oHolyWater that I was saving in case my unihorn got cursed (and 
it never did). Still, the Master Key kept me from any real danger; on 
the Astral Plane I was never more than about 20 hp below max.

Rogues are good fighters and decent casters. I think I'll start another 
one. :)


